## Docker

```bash
cp .env.example .env
docker compose --profile development up --build
```

Open `http://localhost:8000/api/docs/`, `/api/redoc/`, `/health/live/`, and `/health/ready/`.

## Without Docker

```bash
python -m venv .venv
source .venv/bin/activate
python -m pip install -r requirements.txt
python manage.py migrate
python manage.py seed
python manage.py createsuperuser
python manage.py runserver
```

PowerShell activation is `.\.venv\Scripts\Activate.ps1`. For SQLite local development, set
`DATABASE_URL=sqlite:///db.sqlite3`; production settings reject SQLite.

Run tests with `python -m pytest` and deployment checks with
`python manage.py check --deploy --settings=config.settings.production`.

Production requires a TLS-terminating edge proxy, real host/origin values in `.env`, protected
secret files, and the production override:

```bash
NOXUS_DEPLOYMENT_PROFILE=production docker compose -f compose.yaml -f compose.production.yaml \
  --profile production up --build --detach
```
